#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please choose the default text editing component that you wish to use in "
"this application. If you choose <B>System Default</B>, the application will "
"honor your changes in the Control Center. All other choices will override "
"that setting."
msgstr ""
"Prošu wubjerće sej standardnu komponentu za editowanje tekstow, kiž "
"chceće w tutym programje wužiwać. Wubjereće-li <B>Systemowy "
"standard</B>, změje so program po wašich nastajenjach w Control Center. "
"Wšitke druhe změni tute nastajenje."

